   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,891:               cli.py:  103: /Users/chind/dev/mbie_hackathonaug26/buildwithcoco.md
    INFO: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,892:         converter.py:   14: /Users/chind/dev/mbie_hackathonaug26/buildwithcoco.md
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,897:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Build with CoCo: Leadership needs proactive insights into Health
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,902:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: and Safety
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,904:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: What is needed from you
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,953:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The organisation has a responsibility to manage health and safety across more than 2000 schools in New Zealand.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,982:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: They have identified two major areas where they need better insights into Health and Safety.  The data and insights
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,995:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: team (thats you) have been tasked with rapidly developing a MVP solution that will address 1, or both key themes.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,996:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: The leadership team assumed it would take months but the Chief Data Officer said you could build a MVP in a day.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,997:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Today you need to:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:11,997:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 👩‍💻 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,171:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Design and Build a prototype solution to provide the LT with better insights
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,174:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 🧑‍🏫 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,343:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Provide a 5-7 minute showcase of your solution
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,344:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: How can this be done in a day?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,345:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: You will leverage ❄️ 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,345:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Snowflake
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,346:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  ❄️ and ❄️
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,347:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Snowflake CoCo
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,348:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ❄️ to rapidly design and build your solution.  You get to choose
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,349:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: what you want to build.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,350:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,351:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Want to build an Interactive Streamlit application to all the LT to slice and dice the data? Go for it.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,353:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,354:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Want to train machine leaning model to create a risk score for each site? Sounds cool. CoCo loves
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,355:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ML
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,356:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,357:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Need to ingest or generate some new data to make your demo pop? CoCo can help here to.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,358:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,359:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Want to allow the leadership team to ask Natural language questions via a chat interface? CoCo
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,360:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: builds agents.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,361:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,363:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Want to build a beautiful HTML presentation that could be used at the next board meeting to present
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,364:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: key Health and Saftey KPI
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,365:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,365:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s and metrics? Yup...CoCo
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,366:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,367:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Need to document your solution and the architecure? CoCo also does the boring stuff.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,368:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Where do we start?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,369:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Heres a high level workflow you might want to follow :
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,369:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,375:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ask CoCo to help understand what kind of insights might be useful to meet the business needs? or
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,376:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: explore why the business really needs to have better insights? 💡
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,377:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: HINT:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,378:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  this may be useful for to help
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,379:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: frame up your demonstration
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,380:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,381:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Use CoCo to help you design some more detailed requirements?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,381:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,382:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Ask CoCo to take your more detailed requirements and design a solution 💡
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,383:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: HINT:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,384:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Use 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,385:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Plan
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,385:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  mode in
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,386:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: CoCo
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,387:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,388:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Once you have refined your Plan get CoCo to built it.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,389:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,390:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Test it. Use CoCo to fix bugs, make refinements, add new features.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,391:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  6 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,392:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Use CoCo to help create a presentation if you want one for your demo. 💡
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,393:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: HINT:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,394:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  CoCO is not bad at
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,394:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: creating HTML presentations.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,396:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Theme 1: Incident Insights
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,397:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Business Context:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,398:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,398:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,401:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Our organisation records workplace incidents across multiple sites and regions, but we lack the
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,402:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ability to quickly understand what
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,403:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,405:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s happening, where, and why. Leadership wants to move from reactive reporting
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,405:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: to proactive insight.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,406:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,407:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Business Needs:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,408:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,409:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Trend 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,409:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,410:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Pattern Analysis
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,419:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Identify emerging patterns in incident frequency, severity, and type
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,422:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: across time, location, team, and activity. Detect when a site or region is trending upward in
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,423:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: near-misses before a serious harm event occurs.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,424:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,424:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Incident Classification 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: &
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,425:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  Summarisation
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,434:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Incident narratives are free-text and inconsistently
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,438:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: categorised by reporters. Automatically classify incidents by type, body part affected, root cause
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,439:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: category, and generate concise summaries for leadership reporting.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,439:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,440:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Self-Service Questioning
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,443:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Enable non-technical managers and regional leaders to ask
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,444:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: natural-language questions about incident data (e.g., 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,444:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: How many serious harm incidents occurred in
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,446:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: the Wellington region this quarter?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,447:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,447:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  or 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,448:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,449:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: What are the top 3 incident types for contractor staff?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,449:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,450:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ) and
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,451:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: receive trustworthy answers.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,452:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Example questions teams should enable:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,452:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: What are the incident trends by month, region, and severity over the past 12 months?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,454:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,455:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Which sites have a disproportionate share of serious harm vs. near-miss incidents?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,456:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,457:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Are there seasonal or day-of-week patterns in certain incident types?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,458:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: What are the most common root causes extracted from incident narratives?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,459:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,460:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Summarise all incidents at Site X in the last 90 days.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,461:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Theme 2: Hazard Management
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,462:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Business Context:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,463:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,464:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,469:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: We have obligations as a PCBU under the Health and Safety at Work Act to manage workplace
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,470:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: risks. We conduct risk assessments, site inspections, and track hazards — but it
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,471:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,475:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s hard to see the full picture across
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,476:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: hundreds of sites, dozens of contractors, and thousands of open action items.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,477:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,478:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Business Needs:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,478:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  1 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,479:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Site Risk Visibility
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,480:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Provide a composite view of each site
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,481:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,486:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s risk posture based on inspection results,
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,489:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: open hazards, incident history, and time-since-last-assessment. Enable prioritisation of inspection
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,490:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: resources toward highest-risk sites.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  2 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,491:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Action Item Accountability
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,495:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Surface overdue corrective actions from risk assessments and
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,496:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: inspections. Show who owns them, how long they
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,497:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,498:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ve been overdue, and enable escalation visibility.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,499:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  3 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,499:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Hazard Extraction from Field Notes
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,507:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Inspectors write unstructured field notes during site visits.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,511:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Automatically extract mentioned hazards, affected equipment/areas, and suggested controls from
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,512:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: those notes to enrich the hazard register.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,513:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  4 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,514:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Contractor Safety Performance
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,515:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Consolidate each contractor
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,515:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,522:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s safety record across all sites — incidents
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,524:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: attributed to them, inspection non-compliances, expired certifications — into a single performance view
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,525:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: to inform procurement decisions.
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,526:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  5 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,527:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Self-Service Questioning
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,529:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  — Enable managers to ask natural-language questions about hazard and risk
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,530:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: data (e.g., 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,531:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,531:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Which sites have overdue high-risk actions?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,532:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,533:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment:  or 
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,534:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,535:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: What is Contractor X
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,536:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: '
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,537:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: s safety record
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,538:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: this year?
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,538:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: "
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,539:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: ).
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,540:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Example questions teams should enable:
   DEBUG: 2026-08-24 16:05:12,541:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
